messages.content:
Berikut manifest game **Bloodstream Runner** — Endless Runner arcade bertema aliran darah dengan gaya Retro Pixel dan kesulitan Normal.

```js
AISYS.defineGame({
  schema: 1, kit: "endless-runner",
  id: "bloodstream-runner", title: "Bloodstream Runner", seed: "bloodstream-01",
  theme: { preset: "retro-pixel" },

  player: { x: 220, w: 44, h: 56, gravity: 2400, jumpVelocity: 900, lives: 3, invulnerableSec: 1.2 },
  world:  { groundY: 600, speed: 360, maxSpeed: 720, accel: 6 },

  spawner: {
    interval: [0.9, 1.5],
    table: [
      { type: "hazard", id: "kolesterol", w: 44, h: 48, weight: 3 },
      { type: "hazard", id: "plak-lemak", w: 90, h: 24, weight: 2 },
      { type: "hazard", id: "sel-darah", w: 40, h: 40, weight: 2 },
      { type: "item", weight: 5, heights: ["ground", "mid", "high"] }
    ]
  },

  rules: {
    perSecond: 5,
    correct: { score: 50, sfx: "coin" },
    wrong:   { score: -20, sfx: "hit", showExplain: false },
    hazard:  { lives: -1, sfx: "hit", shake: 8 },
    combo:   { step: 5, max: 4 },
    difficulty: { everySec: 15, speed: 25 }
  }
});
// END_OF_MANIFEST
```

Game ini adalah arcade murni tanpa konten belajar, dengan tiga jenis rintangan organik dan koin skor; asumsi pentingnya, semua rintangan memakai ukuran aman agar tetap bisa dilompati pada kecepatan Normal.
